{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國國防企業BAE系統公司（BAE Systems）近日展示了一項新的反無人機技術：通過在大型四旋翼無人機上安裝多聯裝激光制導火箭發射器，使其能夠在一次任務中連續攻擊多個空中目標，而不必每次攔截後返回地面重新裝填。這項技術旨在以相對較低的成本應對數量龐大、價格低廉的攻擊無人機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583676.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.497370+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996984+00:00","content_hash":"57852aec2887a0d79b1803bf0cddbb140e6e87733b44888981c1f36bed90010b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}